&lt;div class=&#34;admonition note&#34;&gt;
&lt;p class=&#34;admonition-title&#34;&gt;Early Access&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Email invites@kwk.co if you would like to join the alpha team, please provide a short description about why you are interested in using kwk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 id=&#34;basic-account-commands&#34;&gt;Basic account commands&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Follow on screen instructions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34;&gt;kwk signup
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34;&gt;kwk signin
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34;&gt;kwk signout
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;h3 id=&#34;reset-password&#34;&gt;Reset password&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34;&gt;kwk reset-password
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;h3 id=&#34;change-password-after-a-reset-or-with-existing-password&#34;&gt;Change password (after a reset or with existing password)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34;&gt;kwk change-password
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
